A quantified contract on a legacy closure also requires conformance.
The implementation's original experiment setting cannot bypass validation.

-- legacy.cue --
@experiment(functions,quantified=false)
f: func(x: int & >0) -> (int & >=0): x - 1
-- in.cue --
@test(validate)
@test(validate, concrete, incomplete, at="f")
f: func(int & >0) -> (int & >=0)
